      "comment": "Smiley Yanxiao: Almond Tofu and the Wangshu ghost",
      "content": "Xiao will only appear if someone offers him Almond Tofu, which Yanxiao normally makes. After a traveller told Yanxiao the inn was haunted and he saw something in the kitchen, his hands were too shaky for the delicate dessert. The Traveler and Paimon confirmed a ghost, persuaded her to stop haunting the inn, and Yanxiao made them the tofu. He reports that after that he stopped seeing anything odd.",
