      "comment": "Smiley Yanxiao: Silverwing in Pursuit of the Moon",
      "content": "In the 7.1 Moonchase event the Liyue food street hosts cooks from Fontaine. Yanxiao says Fontainian flavors are new to him. He swaps tofu from beans he ground himself for fermented juice from Hotel Debord cooks, plans to cook for Jiangxue with it, and helps Xiangling make authentic Five-Nut Wangxiao Cakes for a tasting hosted by Escoffier.",
